# Real software, next sizes (owner 2026-11-09 01:45: scale the library checks by incrementing the explored sizes). brain01, 48 h tier, Offline only.
# raft-rs: (1,2,2) and (1,3,1) exports and joins against S_raft, and the (2,1,1) export retried (.r2: the 11-04 run died of a full disk on brain01, exit 101), joined with the existing S_raft export.
# MicroRaft: the (1,1,2) export under JMC, then its joins against the Rust S_raft and against raft-rs in both directions ((2,1,1) reached 48 h on 11-05).
# OmniPaxos: (3,0,1) and (2,0,2) exports and joins against S_raft.
C3E.raft-rs.spec_correct_1_2_2_fifo.t16.c48h 250 172800 "$DAAVAR"/scripts/rust-run.sh raft-rs export spec --out export.jsonl --threads 16 --model fifo -- correct 1 2 2
